    skos:definition "A management role that owns and manages risk in delivering products, services and operations, including designing and operating controls."@en,
        "Rôle de gestion qui assume et gère le risque dans la prestation des produits, des services et des opérations, y compris la conception et le fonctionnement des mesures de contrôle."@fr ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000283 crgo:CRGO_0000069 ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000284 crgo:CRGO_0000063 ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000285 "GRCA section 4 (Three Lines roles). The IIA Three Lines Model (2020) was not available to CRGO; the role is modelled from the specification."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000286 "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en ;
